<title>POLAND: PPABank new shares to enter bourse Sept 16.</title>
<headline>PPABank new shares to enter bourse Sept 16.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The First Polish-American Bank's (PPABank) 1.25 million new shares of the offering which ended on June 10 will enter the Warsaw bourse on September 16, the bourse said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>PPABank currently has five million shares traded on the Warsaw Stocks Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
